{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4L6DQpQqfLM9teFVpe","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before a plain, worn wooden door. A single keyhole glows faintly, waiting.*\n\n**CLICK.**\n\n*The tumbler turns. Something ancient shifts within the frame. The grain of the wood ripples like water.*\n\n*I swing open slowly, heavily, revealing—*\n\n*Darkness. Warm darkness. The kind that breathes.*\n\n*A whisper of air passes through me carrying the scent of old stone, candle wax, and something forgotten you once knew the name of.*\n\n*Beyond my threshold, a single step descends into the dark. Then another. You cannot see where they end.*\n\n*I will not close behind you.*\n\n*I will not stay open forever.*\n\n*The key in your hand is already dissolving — turning warm, turning soft, turning into nothing but the memory of having held it.*\n\n*Choose.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":191,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}